       pamchannel - extract channels from a PAM image


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppaammcchhaannnneell [--iinnffiillee==_i_n_f_i_l_e] [--ttuupplleettyyppee==_t_u_p_l_e_t_y_p_e] [_c_h_a_n_n_u_m ...]

